@baseUrl = http://localhost:5032
@jwtToken = REPLACE_WITH_MEDX_JWT
@centreId = MR2610-00001
@ruleId = 1

### Batch-sync selected orders; CRM and LIS share one batchId according to each patient's rules
# Prepares the inclusive range for all enabled rules before resolving selected centreIds.
# Existing succeeded orders are updated. Inspect both target and order outcomes on HTTP 207.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Sync/orderpatients
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "start_date": "2026-11-10",
  "end_date": "2026-11-11",
  "centreIds": ["MR2611-00001", "MR2611-00002", "MC2611-00001"]
}

### Invalid empty batch: 400, no synchronization
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Sync/orderpatients
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "start_date": "2026-11-10",
  "end_date": "2026-11-11",
  "centreIds": []
}

### Missing batch dates: 400, no preparation or synchronization
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Sync/orderpatients
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "centreIds": ["MR2611-00001"]
}

### Reversed batch dates: 400, no preparation or synchronization
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Sync/orderpatients
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "start_date": "2026-11-11",
  "end_date": "2026-11-10",
  "centreIds": ["MR2611-00001"]
}

### History from the globally latest completed batch; no count means all its records
# Record targetSystem comes from history, not batches; batch metadata has no targetSystem.
# Without a target filter, an empty latest batch still returns metadata.
# Uses get_latest_patientdetails_sync_batch; only the last attempt per sync_id is returned.
# History payloads are not returned. Older batches and unfinished batches are not selected.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Sync/recent
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

### Filter history in the globally latest batch; no matching target returns empty results and batches, with no fallback
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Sync/recent?count=10&targetSystem=CRM
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

### Invalid count: 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Sync/recent?count=0
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

### Invalid system: 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Sync/recent?targetSystem=OTHER
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

### Count all synchronization queue rows across all dates and target systems
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Sync/statistics
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

### Generate centreids and preview queues in an inclusive date range; no LIS/CRM upload
# Prepares centreids and queues for enabled rules before reading the preview.
# Each result is one order/target pair; existing synchronization states are retained.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Sync/preview
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "start_date": "2026-11-10",
  "end_date": "2026-11-11"
}

### Missing required date: 400, no centreid generation or queue writes
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Sync/preview
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Invalid date: 400, no centreid generation or queue writes
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Sync/preview
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "start_date": "not-a-date",
  "end_date": "2026-11-11"
}

### Reversed date range: 400, no centreid generation or queue writes
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Sync/preview
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "start_date": "2026-11-11",
  "end_date": "2026-11-10"
}

### Get a rule by generated id
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Sync/rules/{{ruleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

### Update enabled state by id
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/Sync/rules/{{ruleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isEnabled": false
}

### Delete a rule by id; queue entries remain unchanged
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/Sync/rules/{{ruleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

### Invalid id: 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Sync/rules/0
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

### List all routing rules (includes disabled)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Sync/rules
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

### Filter rules by formType
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Sync/rules?formType=DR
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

### Get a rule by composite key
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Sync/rules/DR/LIS
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

### Create a rule; duplicate key returns 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Sync/rules
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "formType": "DR",
  "targetSystem": "LIS",
  "isEnabled": true
}

### Disable a rule; existing queue rows are unchanged
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/Sync/rules/DR/LIS
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isEnabled": false
}

### Missing isEnabled: 400, no database write
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/Sync/rules/DR/LIS
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Delete only the routing rule; 200 with success/message/formType/targetSystem
# Repeating the request after deletion returns 404, not a success response.
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/Sync/rules/DR/LIS
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

### Route this patient using enabled patientdetails_sync_rules; configured tokens only
# Writes to every enabled system. Inspect each result even when HTTP 207 is returned.
# No formtype/targetSystem input: read formtype from the unique final patient.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Sync/orderpatient
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "centreId": "{{centreId}}"
}

### Invalid rule-routed selection: 400, no synchronization
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Sync/orderpatient
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "centreId": " "
}

### LIS configured token
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Sync/lis/token
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

### LIS token using configured form defaults
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Sync/lis/token
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

### Query LIS order
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Sync/lis/order/{{centreId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

### Prepare LIS queue; local centreids/queue may be changed, no remote writes
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Sync/lis/createorders/preview
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "SequenceDate": "2026-11-09",
  "FormTypes": ["DR"],
  "Status": "Matched"
}

### Submit one pending LIS order if its stored formtype has an enabled LIS rule
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Sync/lis/createorder
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "centreId": "{{centreId}}"
}

### Retry a failed/unknown create; verify uncertain remote outcomes before sending
# A matching duplicate confirms order existence, not patient update success.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Sync/lis/createorder/retry
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "CentreId": "{{centreId}}",
  "TargetSystem": "LIS"
}

### Submit pending LIS orders; stops on first failure, inspect HTTP 207 results
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Sync/lis/createorders
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "SequenceDate": "2026-11-09",
  "FormTypes": ["DR"],
  "Status": "Matched"
}

### Update LIS Order from latest local data
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Sync/lis/updateorder
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "centreId": "{{centreId}}"
}

### Update LIS Patient from latest local data
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Sync/lis/updateorderpatient
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "centreId": "{{centreId}}"
}

### Invalid LIS update: 400, no remote writes
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Sync/lis/updateorderpatient
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "centreId": " "
}

### CRM configured token
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Sync/crm/token
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

### CRM token using configured form defaults
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Sync/crm/token
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

### Prepare CRM queue; no Salesforce calls
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Sync/crm/syncPatientdetailsFinal/preview
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sequenceDate": "2026-11-09",
  "formTypes": ["DR"],
  "status": "Matched"
}

### Sync a selected queued patient to CRM using configured credentials
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Sync/crm/syncPatientdetailsFinal
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "centreid": "{{centreId}}",
  "targetSystem": "CRM"
}

### Invalid CRM preview: 400, no database writes
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Sync/crm/syncPatientdetailsFinal/preview
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "formTypes": []
}

### Missing JWT: 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Sync/crm/token
